abstract: >-
  Sharp bounds on nonreciprocal DC compliance and clamped odd stiffness in ideal
  periodically driven reciprocal overdamped spring networks, with a four-coordinate
  attaining construction, proofs, and reproducible checks.
keywords:
  - odd elasticity
  - nonreciprocity
  - mechanical metamaterials
  - time-modulated systems
  - spring networks
  - overdamped dynamics
  - linear response
  - response bounds
  - mathematical physics
  - reproducible research
